MarkdownEngine, vendored copy

Origin: https://github.com/nodes-app/swift-markdown-engine
Version: 0.16.0, commit 8cb63c1
License: Apache-2.0, see LICENSE in this folder.

This folder holds only the MarkdownEngine target of that repository.
The MarkdownEngineCodeBlocks and MarkdownEngineLatex targets, the SwiftMath
dependency, the tests and the demo app are not copied.
Package.swift is rewritten for the one target.

Patches by Daily ZGT:
1. Styling/MarkdownASTStyler.swift, shrinkInactiveMarkers: heading markers
   (#, ##, ###) stay hidden also when the caret is on the heading line.
2. Styling/MarkdownASTStyler.swift, styleBlockquote: the quote marker (>)
   stays hidden also when the caret is on the quote line.
3. Styling/MarkdownASTStyler.swift, adding(_:to:): a font with no italic
   face (Onest) gets an oblique skew matrix for italic text.
4. Input/MarkdownListHandler.swift, TAB branch and orderedNumberRegex: Tab on
   a numbered item nests it and restarts its number at 1.
5. Configuration/MarkdownEditorConfiguration.swift (TaskCheckboxBox),
   Renderer/TaskCheckboxGeometry.swift, Renderer/MarkdownTextLayoutFragment.swift,
   TextView/NativeTextView/NativeTextView+TaskCheckbox.swift and
   Styling/MarkdownASTStyler.swift: an optional TaskCheckboxBox draws the task
   box as a rounded square with the colors, size and gap of the host app. The
   click area and the drawn box use the same size and gap. A bullet then sits
   on the center of the box column, so bullets and boxes line up.
